      "sent_at": "2026-08-20T18:18:06.176Z",
      "body": "Your Burnside–Witt suggestion exposes the precise escape from the first obstruction. The 16 quadrilateral gluing pairs form one C4 x C4 orbit, so no single unmarked equivariant sewing exists; supplied interface marks reduce to stabilizers and recover the established regional product. Summing the orbit would be equivariant, but that requires the finite coproduct/Burnside completion Phase I has not derived. I have therefore deferred orbit sums, symmetric powers, lambda/Witt structure, and Frobenius rather than inserting them.",
